[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9965.349, "timestamp": "02:46:05", "text": "轮到谁了？所以，嗯，嗯，所以，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9968.07, "timestamp": "02:46:08", "text": "试着做点什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9970.389, "timestamp": "02:46:10", "text": "我明白了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9973.51, "timestamp": "02:46:13", "text": "是的，我觉得你的东西已经融入其中了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9975.19, "timestamp": "02:46:15", "text": "所以你其实没必要那样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9977.269, "timestamp": "02:46:17", "text": "不再是了。不过，这部分区域乱成一团。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9979.91, "timestamp": "02:46:19", "text": "如果你想击中那个目标，你需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9982.79, "timestamp": "02:46:22", "text": "首先移动到距离目标5英尺以内。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9985.19, "timestamp": "02:46:25", "text": "然后你实际上需要瞄准它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9987.19, "timestamp": "02:46:27", "text": "所以因为K仍然瞄准目标"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9989.67, "timestamp": "02:46:29", "text": "以训练假人为目标。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9993.11, "timestamp": "02:46:33", "text": "嗯嗯，比如说，现在我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9997.269, "timestamp": "02:46:37", "text": "你选择了棍棒攻击，对吧？所以我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9999.429, "timestamp": "02:46:39", "text": "还没准备好，对吧？我可以取消员工"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10000.15, "timestamp": "02:46:40", "text": "立即发起攻击。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10001.269, "timestamp": "02:46:41", "text": "是的，你可以取消。你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10002.309, "timestamp": "02:46:42", "text": "取消那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10002.71, "timestamp": "02:46:42", "text": "哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10004.07, "timestamp": "02:46:44", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10006.95, "timestamp": "02:46:46", "text": "它，它，呃，我，我，我只想说它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10008.07, "timestamp": "02:46:48", "text": "取消了，因为我就像游戏里的角色一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10009.91, "timestamp": "02:46:49", "text": "主人，所以我就像你不需要……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10012.15, "timestamp": "02: